#!/usr/bin/env sh
# The build's step line, for the progress band above the prompt, never
# for the chat (the build skill, "How the build talks"):
#
#   reboot-now Writing the servicers
#
# Plain words, no quotes: letters, digits and ,.:/_- only, so the
# plugin's auto-approve hook lets it through without a prompt. The
# band reads the line from the command itself. This does nothing else.
